worklog/worklog_yixun/exp_35_orbitrir_yaw_evidence_claude/orbitrir_yaw_evidence_2026-11-05_18-47-53_codex_planner_tooling_P2.log:3861:The transaction guarantee fails at [records_txn.py:349–377](/tmp/claude-1007/-home-yixunhu-codespace-FLAC/1630c6fe-5d3e-42b4-94ec-1b6d3bcb0e4e/scratchpad/r3a/records_txn/records_txn.py:349). `installed` is incremented only after `os.link`/`os.replace` returns. A wrapper can perform the real operation and then raise; an asynchronous exception can land in the same interval. For the first install, `installed` remains zero, so the exception handler removes the manifest and reports that every destination is unchanged even though one changed.
