h (~16:30), ahead of the exp_22 GPU tests and gates; check memory headroom first and do not slow my exp_30 seed-43 training more than the s44 tables did. Give me an ETA. (4) Deliverable: a results file with (a) ONE table (not two) of Vanilla FLAC, CANON and OrbitRIR B-F with the six metrics (T60, C50, EDT, R@1, R@5, R@10) at K=1 and K=8 on unseen AR at theta=0; (b) the same six metrics at 45 deg and under random yaw for the three models; (c) the Tier 3 spread table with B-F added. New experiment number, worklog entry, commit on localization-exp. Report in this pane when the plan is ready and again when the cells are done.
